Package: sessionsifu
Version: 1.1.1
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SessionSifu contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50), gjs, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtop-2.0, procps, libglib2.0-bin
Suggests: ydotool
Description: save and restore complete GNOME desktop layouts
 SessionSifu records running applications and window state, then relaunches
 applications and reconstructs their workspaces, monitors, geometry and state.
 It includes rolling automatic snapshots, a GNOME Shell 50 extension, GTK 4
 manager, top-bar indicator and verified updates from the project repository.
